<div class="card" style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto">
  <h1>How recommendations work</h1>
  <p>NoBossly is free for everyone — every path, every quest, every rung. To keep it that way, some of the tools we recommend are affiliate links: if you sign up or buy through one, NoBossly may earn a commission from that company.</p>
  <h3>What that means for you</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>It never costs you more.</strong> You pay the same price you would going to the company directly.</li>
    <li><strong>It never unlocks anything.</strong> No quest, rung or trophy requires you to buy anything. Every recommendation is optional, and there is always a free or do-it-yourself route.</li>
    <li><strong>We only recommend what fits the step you are on.</strong> A tool shows up next to the quest or guide it actually helps with, not everywhere.</li>
    <li><strong>Links are marked.</strong> Affiliate links on NoBossly are labelled as recommendations and open in a new tab.</li>
  </ul>
  <h3>What we track</h3>
  <p>When you click a recommendation we count the click (which tool, and which page it came from) so we can tell which recommendations are useful. We do not sell your data or share your profile with partners.</p>
  <p class="muted small">Questions? Reach out through the <a href="/help">Help Center</a>.</p>
</div>
